      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DRAW ATTENTION (2) is the one to beat after winning over 1800m at the Sunshine Coast as a short odds-on favourite, travelling well and doing enough late. Her third in a CL1 at this track two runs back also had merit given the interference, and the 3kg claim helps offset the new 2235m assignment. LORD PROTECTOR (7) brings a strong BM70 fourth from Sunshine Coast, where he was again doing his best work late. The drop back to a BM62 gives him a genuine winning avenue. DECARBONISE (8) has improved with racing this campaign, was close up in a BM58 at Gatton after being steadied. Fitter and can play a role at the light weight. DISGRUNTLED (5) brings winning form after getting off the mark in style at the Sunny Coast. Has the scope to go on with the job now.",
